lisa-design:
R79 (API side): PluginReport.InlinePolicies (json inline-policies, omitempty) with
InlinePoliciesSupported/Unsupported/Unknown and the InlinePoliciesValues list. The agent decides
the value from the plugin's lib version; the API only validates the vocabulary (empty allowed for
older agents, anything else -> 400 like mode/status/reason) and stores/returns it inside the
existing plugins jsonb (no migration). PolicyCodePluginLibInlineUnsupported
("plugin-lib-inline-unsupported") is agent-produced only: error for overlay-introduced inline
policies on unsupported plugins, warning for unknown lib versions and file-defined bundles.
